# index.html hero description
#: .\templates\index.html:81
msgid ""
"Mazkur nashr arxitektura, shaharsozlik, bino va inshootlar qurilishi, "
"geodeziya, kartografiya hamda davlat kadastri tizimlarida olib borilayotgan "
"fundamental va amaliy tadqiqotlarning samaradorligini oshirishni maqsad "
"qilgan. Shuningdek, zamonaviy ta'lim metodologiyasini takomillashtirish, "
"tarmoqqa raqamli texnologiyalar, BIM (Building Information Modeling) "
"tizimlari hamda sun'iy idrok algoritmlarini chuqur integratsiya qilish "
"masalalariga bag'ishlangan yuqori salohiyatli tahliliy ma'lumotlar va "
"innovatsion yechimlar manbaidir."
msgstr ""
"This publication aims to increase the efficiency of fundamental and applied "
"research in the fields of architecture, urban planning, construction of "
"buildings and structures, geodesy, cartography, and state cadastre systems. "
"It is also a source of high-potential analytical data and innovative "
"solutions dedicated to improving modern educational methodology and deeply "
"integrating digital technologies, BIM (Building Information Modeling) "
"systems, and artificial intelligence algorithms into the industry."

